Subject: [PATCH 03/19] lto: Make asmlinkage __visible
Date: Fri, 14 Feb 2014 22:21:27 +0100
Message-Id: <1392412903-25733-4-git-send-email-andi@firstfloor.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 1.8.5.2
